# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile compiles, so
# secrets (.env), mirrors (data/) and local binaries never reach the image or
# its build cache. If the build needs a new top-level file or directory,
# re-include it here.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/

# Never send these, even if they appear under an included directory.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
